WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.154 --> 00:00:02.372
- Have you ever asked
yourself the question,

00:00:02.372 --> 00:00:04.720
why haven't I done the things I wanted to?

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.303
Do not listen to the naysayers.

00:00:08.347 --> 00:00:11.051
Purpose is that hidden seed of greatness.

00:00:11.051 --> 00:00:12.919
Stop procrastinating.

00:00:12.919 --> 00:00:14.370
Focus on your goal.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:18.188
Nothing, absolutely nothing is impossible.

00:00:18.188 --> 00:00:19.680
Watch your words.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.061
They become your actions.

00:00:21.061 --> 00:00:22.640
Watch your actions.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.421
They become your habit.

00:00:24.421 --> 00:00:25.254
- Hello Believe Nation.

00:00:25.254 --> 00:00:26.404
My name is Evan Carmichael.

00:00:26.404 --> 00:00:29.259
My one word is believe and
I believe that entrepreneurs

00:00:29.259 --> 00:00:32.057
will solve all of the
world's major problems.

00:00:32.057 --> 00:00:33.505
So to help on your journey today,

00:00:33.505 --> 00:00:36.691
we're going to learn from
empowerment specialist, Cindy Trimm,

00:00:36.691 --> 00:00:39.819
and my take on your top
ten rules of success.

00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:41.343
Rule number one is my personal favorite

00:00:41.343 --> 00:00:43.943
and I love to know which
one you guys like the best.

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.975
As always, as you're watching,
if you hear something

00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:47.648
that really resonates with you,

00:00:47.648 --> 00:00:49.101
please leave it in the comments below.

00:00:49.101 --> 00:00:51.482
Put quotes around it so
other people can be inspired.

00:00:51.482 --> 00:00:53.217
You might win a prize as well.

00:00:53.217 --> 00:00:55.350
Also, when you write it
down, it's much more likely

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:57.543
to stick for yourself as well.

00:00:57.543 --> 00:00:58.376
Enjoy.

00:01:11.518 --> 00:01:13.101
- Evaluate the why.

00:01:14.308 --> 00:01:15.393
The why!

00:01:15.393 --> 00:01:16.676
Yep, the why.

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.539
Have you ever asked yourself the question,

00:01:18.539 --> 00:01:21.132
why haven't I done the things I wanted to?

00:01:21.132 --> 00:01:23.910
Have you ever wondered
why others seem to get

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:27.822
the breaks in life and you
are stuck in a dead-end job,

00:01:27.822 --> 00:01:30.515
a marriage that was over a long time ago,

00:01:30.515 --> 00:01:32.575
a condition that is debilitating you

00:01:32.575 --> 00:01:35.088
physically, emotionally, mentally?

00:01:35.088 --> 00:01:36.635
Why haven't you realized your dream

00:01:36.635 --> 00:01:40.127
or why did you give up
your personal power?

00:01:40.127 --> 00:01:43.327
And why are feeling as if
you're a victim of circumstance?

00:01:43.327 --> 00:01:47.413
And why do you consider yourself
a statistic, a demographic,

00:01:47.413 --> 00:01:50.581
that other people are able
to benefit from but you can't

00:01:50.581 --> 00:01:55.299
benefit from your own
product, a brand called you?

00:01:55.299 --> 00:01:57.796
Why do you stay in that relationship

00:01:57.796 --> 00:02:00.060
any way that frustrates you?

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:04.019
Why do you keep eating
when you know the steps

00:02:04.019 --> 00:02:07.366
that you have to take
in order to be healthy?

00:02:07.366 --> 00:02:09.076
I think there's one reason

00:02:09.076 --> 00:02:11.815
and that is because you or someone else

00:02:11.815 --> 00:02:16.327
has convinced you that
this is as good as it gets.

00:02:16.327 --> 00:02:19.763
Why did you buy into that lie that success

00:02:19.763 --> 00:02:23.309
and happiness are just for storybooks?

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:26.302
Or there is no happy ever after?

00:02:26.302 --> 00:02:29.384
And if it's not one thing, it's another.

00:02:29.384 --> 00:02:32.191
Why have you given up your dreams anyway?

00:02:32.191 --> 00:02:35.243
Why have you given up your personal power

00:02:35.243 --> 00:02:38.141
so that someone else
can decide your destiny?

00:02:38.141 --> 00:02:40.368
Why have done this?

00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:44.793
I believe that right now
you could be closer to

00:02:44.793 --> 00:02:47.622
your breakthrough when you understand

00:02:47.622 --> 00:02:51.789
that I also am in the same
position when I recognized

00:02:53.187 --> 00:02:57.227
that God was drawing me to a secret place.

00:02:57.227 --> 00:02:58.398
Wow!

00:02:58.398 --> 00:03:00.086
Doctor Trimm.

00:03:00.086 --> 00:03:01.364
Really?

00:03:01.364 --> 00:03:03.771
I mean, I thought you
were going to come out

00:03:03.771 --> 00:03:06.711
blazing with this big revelation.

00:03:06.711 --> 00:03:07.858
It is big.

00:03:07.858 --> 00:03:11.804
Because if you do the same,
you're going to get the same.

00:03:11.804 --> 00:03:15.133
Sometimes you've got to center yourself

00:03:15.133 --> 00:03:17.514
by taking some me moments.

00:03:17.514 --> 00:03:21.157
Most of us take those me
moments on the telephone

00:03:21.157 --> 00:03:24.094
with people who don't
know where they're going,

00:03:24.094 --> 00:03:26.357
and then you're asking them how to

00:03:26.357 --> 00:03:28.137
get to where you want to go.

00:03:28.137 --> 00:03:29.925
If people don't know where they're going,

00:03:29.925 --> 00:03:32.191
they can not help you to find out

00:03:32.191 --> 00:03:34.572
how to get where you're going.

00:03:34.572 --> 00:03:37.265
So I'm going to challenge you today.

00:03:37.265 --> 00:03:40.974
I'm going to challenge you
to have a Jacob experience.

00:03:40.974 --> 00:03:43.868
Jacob had to leave his family.

00:03:43.868 --> 00:03:45.831
He had to leave the familiar.

00:03:45.831 --> 00:03:47.419
It was for a short time.

00:03:47.419 --> 00:03:50.508
He had to take some me
moments and wrestle.

00:03:50.508 --> 00:03:52.337
He wrestled with himself.

00:03:52.337 --> 00:03:54.420
He wrestled with the why.

00:03:56.221 --> 00:04:00.388
Then I think also many of
us are afraid of aloneness

00:04:01.599 --> 00:04:05.665
because we get aloneness
mixed up with loneliness.

00:04:05.665 --> 00:04:07.020
There is a difference, you know.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:09.883
Loneliness is the absence of people.

00:04:09.883 --> 00:04:13.027
Aloneness is the absence of purpose.

00:04:13.027 --> 00:04:15.254
This is the big why.

00:04:15.254 --> 00:04:19.880
If you know the why, then
you can overcome any how.

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:23.519
You can forever change
the quality of your life.

00:04:23.519 --> 00:04:28.319
The life that you lead by
the words that you speak.

00:04:28.319 --> 00:04:29.866
Have you ever felt that you were trapped

00:04:29.866 --> 00:04:32.936
in a cycle and a struggle of lack?

00:04:32.936 --> 00:04:36.057
Well, you can get off
of that merry-go-round

00:04:36.057 --> 00:04:40.006
of poverty, sickness, and
depression, and you can do it now.

00:04:40.006 --> 00:04:43.797
When you change your words,
you will change your life.

00:04:43.797 --> 00:04:45.437
One of the things that I found out

00:04:45.437 --> 00:04:48.690
and the mistake that I made
in my life back in the day,

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:51.972
I kept talking about the
things that I didn't want.

00:04:51.972 --> 00:04:53.154
I don't want to be poor.

00:04:53.154 --> 00:04:54.075
I don't want this.

00:04:54.075 --> 00:04:55.288
I don't want that.

00:04:55.288 --> 00:04:58.684
Talking about and decreeing
what you don't want

00:04:58.684 --> 00:05:01.496
doesn't bring to you what you want.

00:05:01.496 --> 00:05:05.663
This is why many of us are
caught in these kinds of storms.

00:05:06.747 --> 00:05:10.714
We have health storms, financial
storms, relational storms.

00:05:10.714 --> 00:05:15.649
Maybe some of what is going
on is not happening to us.

00:05:15.649 --> 00:05:19.893
Could it be that it may be
self-fulfilled prophesy?

00:05:19.893 --> 00:05:22.967
Negative words bring
about negative results.

00:05:22.967 --> 00:05:27.018
Positive words, healthy
words, successful words,

00:05:27.018 --> 00:05:29.963
prosperous words will do exactly that.

00:05:29.963 --> 00:05:31.448
It will bring health.

00:05:31.448 --> 00:05:32.712
It will bring happiness.

00:05:32.712 --> 00:05:36.412
It will bring success, and
it will bring prosperity.

00:05:36.412 --> 00:05:38.312
I want to challenge you with one word.

00:05:38.312 --> 00:05:42.361
The word that is most important
for any of us to have.

00:05:42.361 --> 00:05:44.941
It starts with a c, I call it the c word.

00:05:44.941 --> 00:05:47.274
It's that big word, courage.

00:05:50.985 --> 00:05:52.978
All of us need an extra dose of courage.

00:05:52.978 --> 00:05:55.868
I remember very clearly, and as I think

00:05:55.868 --> 00:05:58.818
I can still feel the
butterflies in my stomach

00:05:58.818 --> 00:06:01.965
and my stomach turning,
I was 15 years old.

00:06:01.965 --> 00:06:03.755
I was in England.

00:06:03.755 --> 00:06:07.075
They said, we are going
to show you how to abseil.

00:06:07.075 --> 00:06:10.492
It looks so easy from
where I was standing.

00:06:10.492 --> 00:06:12.143
I said, "I can ace that."

00:06:12.143 --> 00:06:15.654
Until I got to that high
point on the mountain.

00:06:15.654 --> 00:06:19.833
They put me, they harnessed
me up and they said go.

00:06:19.833 --> 00:06:23.742
All of a sudden, the butterflies show up.

00:06:23.742 --> 00:06:26.159
I have absolutely no courage.

00:06:27.098 --> 00:06:31.673
Every ounce of "I can do
it" was drained out of me.

00:06:31.673 --> 00:06:34.101
When I look down to the bottom

00:06:34.101 --> 00:06:35.383
and I was trying to figure out,

00:06:35.383 --> 00:06:39.930
I have never done this,
how am I going to get

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:42.245
from the top to the bottom?

00:06:42.245 --> 00:06:46.313
It started with putting one
foot in front of the other.

00:06:46.313 --> 00:06:47.146
Was I shaking?

00:06:47.146 --> 00:06:48.776
Absolutely.

00:06:48.776 --> 00:06:51.673
I even had a tear coming down my eye.

00:06:51.673 --> 00:06:55.359
But with some coaching and
with a lot of cheering,

00:06:55.359 --> 00:06:58.512
I tell you, I learned how to abseil.

00:06:58.512 --> 00:07:02.187
To me, courage is not saying
that you don't have fear.

00:07:02.187 --> 00:07:06.211
It's not saying that
you don't have anxiety.

00:07:06.211 --> 00:07:08.793
I had to face my fear.

00:07:08.793 --> 00:07:12.156
I had to feel it and
I had to do it anyway.

00:07:12.156 --> 00:07:14.677
That's what courage is all about.

00:07:14.677 --> 00:07:17.994
You ask yourself, can I really do this?

00:07:17.994 --> 00:07:19.973
Can I really go back to school?

00:07:19.973 --> 00:07:23.878
Can I really heal after a broken marriage?

00:07:23.878 --> 00:07:25.482
Can I really go on?

00:07:25.482 --> 00:07:28.733
We all ask those questions sometimes,

00:07:28.733 --> 00:07:32.433
especially if we've been through a storm.

00:07:32.433 --> 00:07:35.531
A financial storm, an emotional storm,

00:07:35.531 --> 00:07:39.255
a relational storm, or
even a health storm.

00:07:39.255 --> 00:07:43.373
When those winds are
blowing, it seems as if

00:07:43.373 --> 00:07:46.456
we're going to capsize in a sea of fear.

00:07:47.735 --> 00:07:49.712
But hang on for one minute.

00:07:49.712 --> 00:07:51.879
Life is made up of storms.

00:07:53.177 --> 00:07:56.532
I've learned from sailing
that it all depends

00:07:56.532 --> 00:07:58.949
on how you adjust your sails.

00:08:00.918 --> 00:08:04.545
To me, riding through the
storms, getting courage,

00:08:04.545 --> 00:08:07.604
starts right here and right here.

00:08:07.604 --> 00:08:10.187
Do not listen to the naysayers.

00:08:11.456 --> 00:08:14.992
If you are going to have a breakthrough,

00:08:14.992 --> 00:08:19.658
you've got to be able to
silence the negative voices.

00:08:19.658 --> 00:08:22.638
That's the next step and
that's the next secret.

00:08:22.638 --> 00:08:27.317
Many of us have too many
people speaking into our ears.

00:08:27.317 --> 00:08:30.316
I just call these people abortionists.

00:08:30.316 --> 00:08:32.447
So you've got to be careful.

00:08:32.447 --> 00:08:35.253
Your dreams, your visions, your desires,

00:08:35.253 --> 00:08:37.948
especially those that have been God-given.

00:08:37.948 --> 00:08:39.627
I want you to pursue them.

00:08:39.627 --> 00:08:43.627
I want you to believe that
all things are possible.

00:08:43.627 --> 00:08:46.579
It is possible for you
to go back to school.

00:08:46.579 --> 00:08:50.027
It is possible for you to
heal your relationship.

00:08:50.027 --> 00:08:53.845
It is possible for you
to go at life alone.

00:08:53.845 --> 00:08:55.673
It is possible.

00:08:55.673 --> 00:08:58.091
Have you ever felt powerless?

00:08:58.091 --> 00:09:00.785
Does it seem like you've
lost control of your life

00:09:00.785 --> 00:09:04.291
or like your life may be
spiraling out of orbit.

00:09:04.291 --> 00:09:06.435
Or maybe it feels like everyone else

00:09:06.435 --> 00:09:09.069
around you is successful or prosperous

00:09:09.069 --> 00:09:12.520
but it just hasn't happened to you yet.

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:15.833
Well, I want you to
discover how to get the most

00:09:15.833 --> 00:09:18.214
of out of every single day of your life.

00:09:18.214 --> 00:09:20.408
I want you to regain that confidence

00:09:20.408 --> 00:09:22.953
and control that you once had.

00:09:22.953 --> 00:09:26.650
And I want you to be able to
squeeze every drop of life

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:30.349
out of every single hour at every second

00:09:30.349 --> 00:09:33.333
out of every single moment.

00:09:33.333 --> 00:09:37.318
I want you to know what it
feels like to get up out of bed

00:09:37.318 --> 00:09:40.774
every single morning excited and energized

00:09:40.774 --> 00:09:43.478
and ready to take on the whole world.

00:09:43.478 --> 00:09:46.794
You might ask, okay, calm
it down a little bit.

00:09:46.794 --> 00:09:49.086
How am I going to do that?

00:09:49.086 --> 00:09:53.664
How am I going to shake
off that powerless feeling?

00:09:53.664 --> 00:09:57.331
I promise you right here, you
will have victory over this

00:09:57.331 --> 00:10:00.324
when you get an understanding
of your true purpose.

00:10:00.324 --> 00:10:03.228
Purpose is that hidden seed of greatness.

00:10:03.228 --> 00:10:05.384
When you know your purpose,

00:10:05.384 --> 00:10:09.114
your life will finally
come right into focus.

00:10:09.114 --> 00:10:09.947
Listen.

00:10:09.947 --> 00:10:12.482
I woke up this morning excited.

00:10:12.482 --> 00:10:16.154
In fact, I wake up
every single day excited

00:10:16.154 --> 00:10:19.227
because I know my life has direction

00:10:19.227 --> 00:10:20.612
and I know where I'm going.

00:10:20.612 --> 00:10:25.105
Purpose is the why, that
big why for you being alive.

00:10:25.105 --> 00:10:29.103
When you find your why,
the when, the what,

00:10:29.103 --> 00:10:31.825
the how takes care of themselves.

00:10:31.825 --> 00:10:36.015
When you discover your purpose,
you will act decisively,

00:10:36.015 --> 00:10:37.577
you will accomplish your goals.

00:10:37.577 --> 00:10:39.014
You're going to be able to feel alive.

00:10:39.014 --> 00:10:41.255
You're going to make right wise choices.

00:10:41.255 --> 00:10:44.194
You're going to know what to say no to.

00:10:44.194 --> 00:10:46.742
Knowing what to say no
to gives you the ability

00:10:46.742 --> 00:10:50.615
to say yes what you should say yes to.

00:10:50.615 --> 00:10:52.929
You want to say yes to the right things.

00:10:52.929 --> 00:10:56.991
So when we talk about
purpose, it is actually

00:10:56.991 --> 00:11:00.486
one of the most important
conversations we can ever have.

00:11:00.486 --> 00:11:02.084
So many people are living life

00:11:02.084 --> 00:11:04.617
based on someone else's purpose.

00:11:04.617 --> 00:11:06.802
Why would you want to be a refrigerator

00:11:06.802 --> 00:11:08.842
if God has called you be a blender.

00:11:08.842 --> 00:11:11.476
Don't even think about being a blender

00:11:11.476 --> 00:11:13.894
if God has called you to be a microwave.

00:11:13.894 --> 00:11:16.016
You should not even want to be a microwave

00:11:16.016 --> 00:11:18.255
if you're called to be a washing machine.

00:11:18.255 --> 00:11:22.600
In order to feel alive, you
need to live life on purpose.

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:25.239
In order to feel
successful, in order for you

00:11:25.239 --> 00:11:28.376
to gain prosperity, in
order for you to overcome

00:11:28.376 --> 00:11:32.535
obstacles, you need to
discover your purpose.

00:11:32.535 --> 00:11:35.488
Empowerment is one of those
words that's thrown around.

00:11:35.488 --> 00:11:38.475
You have empowerment specialists,
people all over the place.

00:11:38.475 --> 00:11:41.621
You see signs about
living the empowered life.

00:11:41.621 --> 00:11:46.073
Very few people have explained
to us what empowerment is.

00:11:46.073 --> 00:11:51.029
Let me give you this just simple
definition of empowerment.

00:11:51.029 --> 00:11:53.948
Empowerment simply means that you

00:11:53.948 --> 00:11:56.154
are back in the driver's seat.

00:11:56.154 --> 00:11:58.892
Life does not have to happen to you.

00:11:58.892 --> 00:12:01.035
You can happen to life.

00:12:01.035 --> 00:12:01.875
Here's a thing.

00:12:01.875 --> 00:12:04.901
Life comes at you one day at a time.

00:12:04.901 --> 00:12:07.341
If you can just learn how to live

00:12:07.341 --> 00:12:09.758
and manage for that 24 hours,

00:12:10.642 --> 00:12:13.642
then 24 years will not be a problem.

00:12:14.487 --> 00:12:17.753
When we talk about
empowerment, a lot of people

00:12:17.753 --> 00:12:21.128
say okay, if I live the empowerment life,

00:12:21.128 --> 00:12:23.999
what does that feel like?

00:12:23.999 --> 00:12:25.969
What does it look like?

00:12:25.969 --> 00:12:28.727
To me, it means that when
you wake up in the morning,

00:12:28.727 --> 00:12:32.963
you already have a plan for
the next 24 hours of the day.

00:12:32.963 --> 00:12:35.360
Then you're also able to deal with

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:39.272
those bumps in the road,
those turns in the road.

00:12:39.272 --> 00:12:42.122
The times when you don't feel like doing

00:12:42.122 --> 00:12:46.850
what you know you should do,
empowerment comes in handy.

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:48.679
Stop procrastinating.

00:12:48.679 --> 00:12:50.890
Focus on your goals.

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:53.097
When you focus on what you want,

00:12:53.097 --> 00:12:57.301
what you don't want
automatically leaves your life.

00:12:57.301 --> 00:13:00.682
Don't focus on eliminating anything.

00:13:00.682 --> 00:13:04.060
Focus on creating what you want.

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:07.694
So you're either going to
spend all your energies

00:13:07.694 --> 00:13:10.056
eliminating what you don't want

00:13:10.056 --> 00:13:15.051
or you spend your energies
creating what you want.

00:13:15.051 --> 00:13:18.326
We all have alibis, we're all busy.

00:13:18.326 --> 00:13:20.311
Busy doing what?

00:13:20.311 --> 00:13:21.640
(audience member mumbles a reply)

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:25.689
I'm going to challenge you,
stay focused on your goals

00:13:25.689 --> 00:13:28.195
and if you don't have
goals, write your goals.

00:13:28.195 --> 00:13:32.650
One of the greatest enemies
of fulfillment of purpose

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:35.650
is procrastination and broken focus.

00:13:37.177 --> 00:13:41.880
If you start now and you say
365 days from today's date,

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.532
this is what I want to
accomplish, and you do one a day,

00:13:45.532 --> 00:13:49.228
pose that focus, this one thing I do.

00:13:49.228 --> 00:13:50.868
I'm focusing.

00:13:50.868 --> 00:13:52.327
You do one a day.

00:13:52.327 --> 00:13:56.494
At the end of one year, you
will have made 365 steps

00:14:00.977 --> 00:14:03.405
to one's fulfillment of purpose.

00:14:03.405 --> 00:14:07.572
Who is not going to be successful
at the end of their life?

00:14:08.795 --> 00:14:12.028
Who's not going to be prosperous
at the end of their life

00:14:12.028 --> 00:14:13.564
if they can fulfill that?

00:14:13.564 --> 00:14:17.540
Nothing, absolutely
nothing, is impossible.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:19.864
You can begin again.

00:14:19.864 --> 00:14:21.975
You can believe God again.

00:14:21.975 --> 00:14:23.930
You can trust again.

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.754
You can be successful.

00:14:25.754 --> 00:14:29.206
You can overcome your addictions.

00:14:29.206 --> 00:14:30.289
You can heal.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:33.393
You can feel alive again.

00:14:35.124 --> 00:14:39.291
This is when you realize that
those things are possible.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.544
You are getting a breakthrough.

00:14:42.544 --> 00:14:46.438
So I want to encourage you right now,

00:14:46.438 --> 00:14:48.965
don't give in, go for it.

00:14:48.965 --> 00:14:50.007
Don't give up.

00:14:50.007 --> 00:14:52.287
Don't throw in the towel.

00:14:52.287 --> 00:14:55.701
Even if your back is up against the wall,

00:14:55.701 --> 00:14:59.420
even if you are on the
ropes and you are receiving

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:03.054
a rope-a-dope financially, listen.

00:15:03.054 --> 00:15:04.887
You got to fight back.

00:15:06.325 --> 00:15:08.679
You don't get in life what you want.

00:15:08.679 --> 00:15:11.245
You get what you fight for.

00:15:11.245 --> 00:15:14.916
When you decide that my future, my health,

00:15:14.916 --> 00:15:19.547
my marriage, my freedom,
my happiness, my joy,

00:15:19.547 --> 00:15:23.676
my peace, my children
is worth fighting for,

00:15:23.676 --> 00:15:26.972
you are securing your breakthrough.

00:15:26.972 --> 00:15:30.919
When it comes to passion,
it's that thing that generates

00:15:30.919 --> 00:15:33.854
either the greatest joy
or the greatest sorrow.

00:15:33.854 --> 00:15:36.086
Passion to me is self-generated

00:15:36.086 --> 00:15:40.574
and it's a self-generating
tool that you can use

00:15:40.574 --> 00:15:42.991
when times of discouragement.

00:15:45.051 --> 00:15:48.257
Your passion is going
to get you up out of bed

00:15:48.257 --> 00:15:51.755
and is going to get you
hitting at the streets

00:15:51.755 --> 00:15:53.509
and pounding the pavement

00:15:53.509 --> 00:15:56.780
to bring that vision
to pass, that passion.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:59.264
You have the ability to motivate yourself

00:15:59.264 --> 00:16:01.619
and that's what passion is all about.

00:16:01.619 --> 00:16:04.498
When you are able to
concentrate on your purpose,

00:16:04.498 --> 00:16:09.042
to maximize your potential
and to live out your dream.

00:16:09.042 --> 00:16:12.459
When you do that, you now hold the secret

00:16:13.313 --> 00:16:15.453
right in your hand to living life,

00:16:15.453 --> 00:16:17.843
not only on purpose, but with passion.

00:16:17.843 --> 00:16:20.876
That's the thing that gets me
out of bed every single day.

00:16:20.876 --> 00:16:23.212
The passion for what I do.

00:16:23.212 --> 00:16:24.825
It gets me up in the morning.

00:16:24.825 --> 00:16:27.491
It keeps me going late at night.

00:16:27.491 --> 00:16:29.003
And guess what?

00:16:29.003 --> 00:16:33.170
I end up going to bed very,
very seldom exhausted.

00:16:34.075 --> 00:16:37.034
In fact, I always go to bed excited.

00:16:37.034 --> 00:16:39.763
I have to tell myself,
you better go to sleep

00:16:39.763 --> 00:16:41.528
so that you can wake up in the morning.

00:16:41.528 --> 00:16:43.935
Sometimes I go to bed and I feel like,

00:16:43.935 --> 00:16:46.125
wow, I almost don't want to go to sleep

00:16:46.125 --> 00:16:48.842
'cause I don't want to
miss out on something

00:16:48.842 --> 00:16:52.592
that potentially and
possibly take me further

00:16:53.455 --> 00:16:56.643
into realizing my dreams and goals.

00:16:56.643 --> 00:17:00.153
One of the things about passion
is that it's an attitude,

00:17:00.153 --> 00:17:02.155
and your attitude sets the mood

00:17:02.155 --> 00:17:05.505
for everyone and everything around you.

00:17:05.505 --> 00:17:07.602
They get excited because you're excited.

00:17:07.602 --> 00:17:11.314
Especially those people that
work with you and work for you.

00:17:11.314 --> 00:17:13.769
If you are excited about something

00:17:13.769 --> 00:17:17.857
and fascinated about something,
then people's fascination

00:17:17.857 --> 00:17:20.352
and excitement is turned on as well.

00:17:20.352 --> 00:17:23.210
One of the things that someone once said

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:26.902
and they said it like this,
"Chase down your passion

00:17:26.902 --> 00:17:29.643
"like it's the last bus of the night."

00:17:29.643 --> 00:17:33.318
This is what a guy by
the name of Glade Addams,

00:17:33.318 --> 00:17:35.947
and look at his name, Glade, of all names.

00:17:35.947 --> 00:17:39.198
He has the right to talk about passion.

00:17:39.198 --> 00:17:44.155
What you concentrate on all day
long determines your future.

00:17:44.155 --> 00:17:46.385
Now, here's the most important thing,

00:17:46.385 --> 00:17:49.700
that if you are able to
concentrate your thoughts

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:54.588
one hour daily meditating,
praying, and thinking about

00:17:54.588 --> 00:17:58.378
the person you intend to do,
or the person you intend to be

00:17:58.378 --> 00:18:01.014
or to become, the places you want to go,

00:18:01.014 --> 00:18:02.800
the things you want to accomplish,

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:05.354
what you want to invent,
create, the wealth

00:18:05.354 --> 00:18:08.009
you want to accumulate,
the people with whom

00:18:08.009 --> 00:18:11.363
you want to network, the
lives you will change,

00:18:11.363 --> 00:18:13.591
the legacy you will lead.

00:18:13.591 --> 00:18:16.534
You will literally create in your mind

00:18:16.534 --> 00:18:20.742
a clear picture of the
inevitable, believe it or not.

00:18:20.742 --> 00:18:25.058
This is going to fuel
your daily activities

00:18:25.058 --> 00:18:28.013
as well as what comes out of your mouth.

00:18:28.013 --> 00:18:31.439
I read somewhere one
time, watch your thoughts.

00:18:31.439 --> 00:18:32.793
They become your words.

00:18:32.793 --> 00:18:34.187
Watch your words.

00:18:34.187 --> 00:18:35.692
They become your actions.

00:18:35.692 --> 00:18:37.221
Watch your actions.

00:18:37.221 --> 00:18:38.691
They become your habit.

00:18:38.691 --> 00:18:40.018
Watch your habit.

00:18:40.018 --> 00:18:41.622
They become your character.

00:18:41.622 --> 00:18:43.364
Watch your character.

00:18:43.364 --> 00:18:45.423
It becomes your destiny.

00:18:45.423 --> 00:18:48.506
And it all starts with your thoughts.

